## 🚀 Deploy in 3 Minutes

### Option A: Netlify (Easiest)
```bash
1. Go to netlify.com
2. Click "New site from Git"
3. Select your GitHub repository
4. Click "Deploy"
✅ Live! (HTTPS automatic)
```

### Option B: Vercel
```bash
1. Go to vercel.com
2. Click "New Project"
3. Import your GitHub repo
4. Click "Deploy"
✅ Live! (Global CDN)
```

### Option C: GitHub Pages
```bash
1. Push to GitHub
2. Go to Settings → Pages
3. Select "main" branch
4. Save
✅ Live at username.github.io
```

### Option D: FTP Upload
```bash
1. Upload all files to your hosting
2. Keep folder structure
3. Set permissions (755 dirs, 644 files)
✅ Live at your domain
```

## ⚡ Quick Customizations

### Change Colors
Edit in `assets/css/styles.css`:
```css
:root {
    --accent-red: #FF0000;      /* Change accent */
    --text-primary: #1A1A1A;    /* Change text */
    --bg-primary: #F5F5F5;      /* Change background */
}
```

### Update Projects
Edit `assets/data/projects.json`:
```json
{
    "title": "Your Project",
    "type": "web-design",
    "client": "Your Client",
    "year": 2025,
    "description": "Project description"
}
```

### Add New Project Card (Portfolio Page)
In `portfolio.html`, copy and modify:
```html
<article class="project-card project-item" data-type="web-design">
    <div class="project-image"></div>
    <div class="project-overlay">
        <h3>Your Project Title</h3>
        <p class="project-type">Web Design</p>
    </div>
</article>
```

### Update Social Links
In footer of all pages:
```html
<a href="https://github.com/amarten1112">GitHub</a>
<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/arnold-marten/">LinkedIn</a>
```

### Set Up Contact Form

**Using Formspree (Easiest):**
1. Go to formspree.io
2. Enter your email
3. Copy the Form ID
4. In `main.js`, modify:
```javascript
fetch('https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_ID', {
    method: 'POST',
    body: JSON.stringify(formData)
})
```

**Using Netlify (If deployed there):**
Just add `netlify` attribute:
```html
<form method="POST" netlify>
```

